OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn isolated morning shower is
OL,6,Fpossible in the far west. Otherwise it
OL,7,Fwill be a sunny start to the weekend.
OL,8,FCloud bubbles up for a time by the
OL,9,Fafternoon, then sunnier again later.
OL,10,FFeeling cool in light, generally
OL,11,Fnortherly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny lingering cloud
OL,14,Fdissipating through the evening to
OL,15,Fleave long clear spells during the
OL,16,Fovernight period. Frost and isolated
OL,17,Ffog patches possible in prone
OL,18,Flocations by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,174,160,301,260,100,100
