OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F173A1792210673
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAnother sunny start on Sunday,
OL,6,Fwith patchy cloud once again bubbling
OL,7,Fup during the day. A low chance of
OL,8,Fisolated showers in the far east.
OL,9,FRemaining chilly, with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FShowers move westwards across the
OL,13,Fcountry through Monday, clearing
OL,14,Flater. A dry interlude follows, before
OL,15,Fmore rain develops on Tuesday and
OL,16,FWednesday. Temperatures nearer
OL,17,Faverage, though possibly windy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
